## 🗂️ Folder Structure  

```bash
Agents/
│
├── Goal-Based/                # Gemini-powered job assistant
│   ├── .env                  # API config
│   ├── goal_based_agent.py    # Streamlit app
│   └── goal_based_agent_v3.py # Enhanced version
│
├── Learning_agent.py          # 🐍 Q-learning Snake game
├── Simple_Reflex_Agent.py     # 🧹 Vacuum cleaner simulator
