test_runnable_events_v1.py,libs/core/tests/unit_tests/runnables/test_runnable_events_v1.py,7389d887769d816084531a40e8683901654ffb40,mahima-khera-codes/cookbookAi_langchain,https://api.github.com/repositories/897707228/contents/libs/core/tests/unit_tests/runnables/test_runnable_events_v1.py?ref=50e597ae3b03cb235e6c53a6b4c3f07b9332a55c,https://api.github.com/repositories/897707228/git/blobs/7389d887769d816084531a40e8683901654ffb40,https://github.com/mahima-khera-codes/cookbookAi_langchain/blob/50e597ae3b03cb235e6c53a6b4c3f07b9332a55c/libs/core/tests/unit_tests/runnables/test_runnable_events_v1.py,,,0,0,0,21,2024-12-08T08:08:03Z,0,0,"## Quick Install

With pip:

```bash
pip install langchain
```

With conda:

```bash
conda install langchain -c conda-forge
```

### Open-source libraries

- **`langchain-core`**: Base abstractions and LangChain Expression Language.
- **`langchain-community`**: Third party integrations.
  - Some integrations have been further split into **partner packages** that only rely on **`langchain-core`**. Examples include **`langchain_openai`** and **`langchain_anthropic`**.
- **`langchain`**: Chains, agents, and retrieval strategies that make up an application's cognitive architecture.
