## 🛠️ Tech Stack  
- **Frontend:** Vue.js, Vue Router  
- **Backend:** Flask, Flask-RESTful  
- **Database:** SQLite   
- **Styling:** Bootstrap  
- **APIs:** OpenAI and other llms API 

