<p align=""center"">
  <strong>A simple and powerful conversational AI built with 
  <a href=""https://www.langchain.com/"">LangChain</a> and 
  <a href=""https://ollama.com/"">Ollama</a> using the <code>llama3.2:1b</code> model.</strong>
</p>

