## 🔧 Development

```bash
# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run tests
python test_casebuilder_verification.py

# Start development server
python main.py
```

## 🐳 Docker (Optional)

```bash
docker-compose up --build
```

## 📚 Full Documentation

See `docs/` folder for complete documentation.

