async_client.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/async_client.py,8bebed3237c478b364d02020d9811a940158e350,DeepakMaganti/pdf-qa-backend,https://api.github.com/repositories/1000429022/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/async_client.py?ref=db10ad1b1d14548a0aaef96bc9e779cb990a765f,https://api.github.com/repositories/1000429022/git/blobs/8bebed3237c478b364d02020d9811a940158e350,https://github.com/DeepakMaganti/pdf-qa-backend/blob/db10ad1b1d14548a0aaef96bc9e779cb990a765f/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/async_client.py,,,0,0,0,11,2025-06-14T18:24:16Z,0,0,"# PDF QA Backend

A FastAPI-based backend service for PDF Question Answering using OpenAI and vector search.

## Features

- PDF upload and processing
- Text extraction and chunking
- Vector storage using ChromaDB
- Question answering using OpenAI GPT-4
- RESTful API endpoints

## Project Structure

```
.
├── app/
│   ├── main.py
│   ├── api/
│   │   └── router/
│   │       ├── qa.py
│   │       └── upload.py
│   ├── core/
│   │   └── config.py
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── pdf_service.py
