---

## 💬 Contact

Feel free to reach out:

* 📧 Email: [shams321karib@gmail.com](mailto:shams321karib@gmail.com)
* 🌐 LinkedIn: [karib-shams](https://www.linkedin.com/in/karib-shams-007975305)
* 🔗 GitHub: [karibshams](https://github.com/karibshams)

