## 🚀 **Quick Start**

### **Option 1: Docker Compose (Recommended)**

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/BuloZB/BuloCloudSentinel.git
cd BuloCloudSentinel

# Configure environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your settings

# Launch full stack
docker-compose up -d

# Access web interface
open http://localhost:3000
```

### **Option 2: Kubernetes Deployment**

```bash
# Deploy with Helm
helm repo add bulocloudsentinel https://helm.bulo.cloud
helm install sentinel bulocloudsentinel/bulocloud-sentinel \
  --set global.domain=yourdomain.com \
  --set ai.gpu.enabled=true
```

### **Option 3: Cloud Deployment**

**AWS (1-Click)**
```bash
# Deploy to AWS EKS
eksctl create cluster --name sentinel-cluster --region us-west-2
kubectl apply -k k8s/aws/
```

**Google Cloud**
```bash
# Deploy to GKE  
gcloud container clusters create sentinel-cluster
kubectl apply -k k8s/gcp/
```

**Azure**
```bash
# Deploy to AKS
az aks create --name sentinel-cluster --resource-group sentinel-rg
kubectl apply -k k8s/azure/
```

