## 🌐 **Deployment Options**

### **Cloud Platforms**

**Amazon Web Services (AWS)**
```yaml
# EKS deployment with Terraform
module ""sentinel_cluster"" {
  source = ""./terraform/aws""
  
  cluster_name = ""sentinel-production""
  node_groups = {
    general = { instance_types = [""m5.xlarge""], min_size = 3, max_size = 10 }
    gpu = { instance_types = [""p3.2xlarge""], min_size = 1, max_size = 5 }
  }
}
```

**Google Cloud Platform (GCP)**
```yaml  
# GKE deployment with GPU nodes
resource ""google_container_cluster"" ""sentinel"" {
  name = ""sentinel-cluster""
  location = ""us-central1""
  
  node_pool {
    name = ""gpu-pool""
    machine_type = ""n1-standard-4""
    
    guest_accelerator {
      type = ""nvidia-tesla-t4""
      count = 1
    }
  }
}
```

**Microsoft Azure**
```yaml
# AKS with GPU support
resource ""azurerm_kubernetes_cluster"" ""sentinel"" {
  name = ""sentinel-cluster""
  resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.sentinel.name
  
  default_node_pool {
    name = ""default""
    node_count = 3
    vm_size = ""Standard_D4s_v3""
  }
  
  node_pool {
    name = ""gpu""
    vm_size = ""Standard_NC6s_v3""
    node_count = 2
  }
}
```

### **Edge Deployment**

**NVIDIA Jetson**
```bash
# ARM64 containers for edge deployment
docker run --runtime nvidia --rm -it \
  -p 8000:8000 \
  bulocloudsentinel/sentinel:arm64 \
  --device cuda \
  --model-path /models/yolov8n-tensorrt.engine
```

**Intel NUC**
```bash  
# x86 edge deployment
docker run --device /dev/dri --rm -it \
  -p 8000:8000 \
  bulocloudsentinel/sentinel:latest \
  --device opencl \
  --inference-backend tflite
```

