## Pre requisites

Install Conda

    - create luca environment
    - conda activate luca

For Neo4J:

    - cd db
    - Create directories 
        - data
        - plugins
        - logs
        - import
        - langfuse_clickhouse_data
        - langfuse_clickhouse_logs
        - langfuse_minio_data
        - postgres
