### Development Setup

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/runagent-dev/runagent.git
cd runagent

# Install development dependencies
pip install -e "".[dev]""

# Run tests
pytest

# Format code
black runagent tests

# Run linting
flake8 runagent tests

# Type checking
mypy runagent
```

