AI-powered video content optimization platform that automatically analyzes videos using **4 working AI systems** to identify and extract viral-worthy clips. Designed to scale to 52 AI systems for complete video intelligence.

## 📋 Documentation

### Core Documentation
- **[System Status](docs/reports/SYSTEM_STATUS.md)** - Current system capabilities and roadmap
- **[API Reference](docs/reports/API_REFERENCE.md)** - Complete API documentation
- **[52 Systems Roadmap](docs/reports/52_SYSTEMS_ROADMAP.md)** - Implementation plan for all AI systems
- **[Deployment Guide](docs/reports/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md)** - Production deployment instructions

### Developer Resources
- **[Developer Guide](docs/reports/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md)** - Getting started for developers
- **[Working Systems Documentation](docs/reports/WORKING_SYSTEMS_DOCUMENTATION.md)** - Detailed docs for 4 working systems
- **[Production Runbook](docs/reports/PRODUCTION_RUNBOOK.md)** - Operations and troubleshooting guide

## 🏗️ System Architecture

