## Technical stack

- Frontend：[Vue.js](https://vuejs.org/)
- Backend：[Python / Django](https://www.djangoproject.com/)
- LLM Framework：[LangChain](https://www.langchain.com/)
- Database：[PostgreSQL + pgvector](https://www.postgresql.org/)

