cache.py,BackEnd/myenv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/cache.py,094dc3377c62f1ccf71300108d7c8c70822bc56a,oumaima-echriyah/Cybersecurity-Chatbot,https://api.github.com/repositories/898617252/contents/BackEnd/myenv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/cache.py?ref=97c21890f4d6327a5f9e5d619a4f741bc18435bf,https://api.github.com/repositories/898617252/git/blobs/094dc3377c62f1ccf71300108d7c8c70822bc56a,https://github.com/oumaima-echriyah/Cybersecurity-Chatbot/blob/97c21890f4d6327a5f9e5d619a4f741bc18435bf/BackEnd/myenv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/cache.py,,,0,0,0,88,2025-01-11T12:33:47Z,0,0,"# Combining Diffusion Models and Language Understanding Models in a Cybersecurity Chatbot with Advanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Using a Microservices Architecture in a DevOps/MLOps Context

## Introduction
This project aims to enhance cybersecurity through a chatbot powered by Diffusion Models and Language Understanding Models. By integrating Advanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and utilizing a microservices architecture in a DevOps/MLOps context, we aim to provide an efficient, scalable, and intelligent chatbot solution for real-time cybersecurity threat management.

Key components of the project include:
- Diffusion Models for advanced generative capabilities.
- Language Understanding Models for effective user interaction.
- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to improve response relevance.
- Microservices architecture for modularity and scalability.
- DevOps/MLOps practices for continuous integration, delivery, and deployment.

